One year, the system truly saves 0.5 minutes a ticket from week 26

  team A before launch                   6.94 min
  team A after launch                    5.78 min
  team B, no system, same weeks, change -0.42 min

  before-and-after for team A            -1.16 min
  difference-in-differences              -0.74 min  (95% interval -1.02 to -0.46)

1,000 simulated years in which the system saves nothing
  before-and-after 'finds' a saving      99.9% of years
  difference-in-differences finds one     2.7% of years

Six teams, one pilot, a system that saves nothing. How often does the pilot team
improve by more than 0.2 minutes against the other five, measured from its last
eight weeks before launch?
  pilot chosen at random        10.2% of years
  pilot chosen as the worst     43.7% of years
